**Slide 10 — Heatmap**
This slide shows the same data from a different angle. The entire color scale is dominated by Brute Force — everything else is so fast it barely registers. It's a good visual summary of just how extreme the performance difference is. The heatmap also makes it easy to see how each algorithm scales with input size down the rows.

